  `Set.range x ⊆ oracleHull x₀ ∧ optimizer ∉ oracleHull x₀`.

Primitive data:
- the initial point `x₀`, step sizes `τ`, iterates `x`, admissible subgradients `g`, and oracle
  points `v`;
